9	/**
10	 * Runs in {@code POST /api/owners} after the telephone-uniqueness check, reading the
11	 * already-normalized body as a variable. When the request carries an email, rejects it if
12	 * another owner already uses the same address (compared lower-cased), throwing
13	 * {@link DuplicateOwnerEmailException} for a 409 before any entity is built or persisted.
